locked_line = "The altar is cold, dark stone, and the seal in it is holding. The stair beneath it opens for the rite and nothing else, and nothing is set on it while the Oathbreaker keeps the door."
unreported_line = "The knight has stood aside, and the stair is open, and there is nothing under the altar but dark.\n\nThe Warden is still down at the ruins waiting to hear it from you, and no champion has ever gone down that stair without being sent. Go and tell her first."
